        <p><span style="font-size:11px; color:#9D5A37; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px;">01 · SWARM COWORK</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px;"><span style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#1A1A1A;">100+ 专家 Agent</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px;"><span style="font-size:11px; color:#737373;">细分领域并行协同</span></p>
